[00:19.96]1. Life in this world can be hard.
[00:26.11]Life in this world can bring tears and pain.
[00:31.51]Still ev’ry day I will say,
[00:37.15]“My life is not in vain.”
[00:40.12](Chorus)
[00:43.10]For God is not unrighteous,
[00:48.10]And he remembers the love I’ve shown.
[00:54.62]So he is ever near me;
[01:00.12]With Jehovah, I’m not alone.
[01:05.62]Yes, God is my provider
[01:11.12]and my protector down to the end.
[01:18.24]Yes, Jehovah is my Father,
[01:24.48]My God and Friend.
[01:51.55]2. Gone are the days of my youth;
[01:57.12]Days of calamity now are here.
[02:02.70]Still through the eyes of my faith,
[02:07.77]My hope is bright and clear.
[02:10.56](Chorus)
[02:13.35]For God is not unrighteous,
[02:18.85]And he remembers the love I’ve shown.
[02:24.61]So he is ever near me;
[02:30.37]With Jehovah, I’m not alone.
[02:36.09]Yes, God is my provider
[02:41.83]and my protector down to the end.
[02:48.86]Yes, Jehovah is my Father,
[02:57.98]My God and Friend.